OL,3,GNEWSA'I feel guilty' - the farmer whose
OL,4,Alamb had Scotland's first case of
OL,5,Abluetongue
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier this year, farmer Fiona Johnson
OL,8,Fmoved her family 350 miles north from a
OL,9,Fsmall village in Bedfordshire to the
OL,10,Fcoast of south west Scotland, hoping to
OL,11,Fstart afresh. She had no livestock,
OL,12,Fjust "dogs and children".
OL,14,FFour months later, having purchased a
OL,15,Fsmall number of animals locally to rear
OL,16,Ffor meat, Fiona's fledgling farm in
OL,17,FCreetown recorded the first ever case
OL,18,Fof bluetongue in Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
