OL,3,GNEWSA'I feel guilty' - the farmer whose
OL,4,Alamb had Scotland's first case of
OL,5,Abluetongue
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was an already-poorly lamb, which
OL,8,FFiona said had not shown typical
OL,9,Fsymptoms - it had been drooling,
OL,10,Fdropping food from its mouth and its
OL,11,Flegs were stiff, but not lame.
OL,13,FExperts believe that midges infected
OL,14,Fwith the potentially deadly disease
OL,15,Fwere blown over the border from
OL,16,FEngland, where there are currently 439
OL,17,Fcases, external.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
